{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55712","headline":"春日登大悲阁（四言回文） · 钱惟治","name":"春日登大悲阁（四言回文）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春城满望，晓阁闲登。\n尘销霁景，定出真僧。\n人怀远思，槛凭危层。\n因圆果证，胜境斯兴。\n（均见明梁桥《冰川诗式》卷二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱惟治","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}